{"articleNo":"228663","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=228663&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2019학년도 고속도로 장학생 선발계획 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2019.08.29","hit":"6398","attachments":[{"name":"고속도로장학재단(붙임).jpg","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=228663&attachNo=82363"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">2019학년도 고속도로장학재단 장학생 선발 계획을 안내해드리니 </span><br><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">해당 학생들의 많은 지원 바랍니다.</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">1. 신청자격 및 선발내용 등 :&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">붙임 참조</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">2.&nbsp;신청기간 : 2019.9.4.(수) ~ 9.30.(월) *우편접수 시 동일자 소인 유효</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">3. 신청서 교부&nbsp;: (재)고속도로장학재단 홈페이지(<a href=\"http://www.hsf.or.kr/\"><u><font color=\"#0066cc\">www.hsf.or.kr</font></u></a>)</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">4. 신청서 접수 : (재)고속도로장학재단(경기 성남시 분당구 황새울로 200번길 34, 1101호)</span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">5. 문의처</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">- (재)고속도로장학재단 : (031)712-8942</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">- 한국도로공사 본사 홍보실&nbsp;: (054)811-1341</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">붙임 선발요강 1부. 끝. </span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
